5. Recitation audio
   Not included in this repository or the built tool. The tool streams
   per-ayah recordings from cdn.islamic.network while the user listens and
   caches them on the phone. Copyright in the recordings belongs to the
   reciters or their estates, who license them to Islamic Network for free,
   non-commercial redistribution; alquran.cloud permits streaming them for
   personal and educational use. The tool is free and credits each reciter
   by name.

